				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I haven't switched non stop man. Playing 1 character for nearly 2 years and another for a year and a half is not switching characters non stop. Now I admit I wasn't Zug for long but getting rid of him and getting Damey and Appoc (which I got the exact same day) is the only impulsive short time switch I've made. My intentions were only to get the bard to cure my skepticism of what the Elementals look like. Then the other day I talked to Raveena for the first time in 3 months and she said I should app Damey to the guild because if you hadn't noticed theres only like 4-5 active bards in CotW. So having all 4 of the characters at the exact time is not switching in my view , I'm just dropping one to a friend who will appreciate the character more then I. I had not been rewarded any gear , if I had I would see the issue. I don't see my decision to sell damey to kobil to be hasty or anything else. I was simply trying not to make the decision of getting in the guild with the wrong class again. Merry Christmas everyone and I will talk to a few of you in game when I return from out of town.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /><br />_________________<br />Nairr...will return</div></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
